  "ruleText": "Ch 103.04 Meetings. The board shall meet quarterly, and at such additional times as may be called for by the chairperson or by vote of the board.\n\nSource. #7516, eff 6-27-01; ss by #14499, eff 3-1-26 (formerly Ch 103.05)",
